                },
                "message": "🐛 Speed up the sp-fetch-inbox picker and fix C-u folder choice\n\n- Read DEVONthink fields in bulk per group, not per record (one Apple Event per field)\n- Hash table for known files when merging; sp-fetch-inbox-devonthink-depth and sp-fetch-inbox-profile options\n- Fix 'Wrong type argument: listp' when choosing the folder after C-u M-x sp-fetch-inbox\n- Tests: one osascript call, no per-item processes, folder names with spaces\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNiCXyk3bC6YPxjXfvkE",
                "tree": {
